WEBVTT

00:24.280 --> 00:25.550
Greetings, Your Highness.

00:26.000 --> 00:27.640
You truly are remarkable.

00:28.336 --> 00:30.480
I wonder where you found
someone from your past.

00:30.752 --> 00:33.000
Yet she managed to secure
the position of Palace Matron.

00:33.456 --> 00:36.000
The fact that Matron Tan
has caught Your Highness's attention

00:36.560 --> 00:38.840
proves she is truly exceptional.

00:42.110 --> 00:44.280
The inner palace
has no shortage of women.

00:45.000 --> 00:46.070
Just like

00:47.030 --> 00:48.470
the rain from the heavens,

00:49.710 --> 00:51.280
one shower after another,

00:52.200 --> 00:53.430
without end.

00:55.632 --> 00:58.790
You've done an excellent job assisting
with the affairs of the Six Palaces.

00:59.390 --> 01:00.430
But don't forget.

01:01.200 --> 01:03.200
The Grand Empress Dowager
and His Majesty

01:03.360 --> 01:06.040
have been hoping to find
a secondary consort for Crown Prince.

01:06.144 --> 01:09.190
I hear the princess of Lanhai will soon
enter the palace to pay her respects.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.920
Perhaps when the time comes,
you should see

01:12.350 --> 01:14.710
whether the two of you
can become sisters.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.510
Your Highness, you're now ranked
last among the Four Consorts.

01:20.840 --> 01:22.200
Why worry about so much?

01:29.280 --> 01:31.136
You resort to every scheme imaginable.

01:31.950 --> 01:33.310
You'll surely face retribution.

01:34.480 --> 01:35.350
My retribution

01:35.840 --> 01:37.280
is holding great power,

01:38.000 --> 01:39.000
beyond defiance.

03:05.780 --> 03:06.544
=Blossoms of Power=

03:06.544 --> 03:09.450
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:09.460 --> 03:12.420
=Episode 24=

03:12.540 --> 03:15.660
(Pure Integrity and Benevolent Heart)

03:15.680 --> 03:16.280
Your Highness,

03:17.080 --> 03:18.190
I must tell you.

03:19.290 --> 03:20.480
During the first treatment,

03:20.490 --> 03:22.368
three needles
will be inserted into your spine.

03:22.560 --> 03:23.240
The pain

03:24.656 --> 03:26.912
will feel like countless ants
gnawing at your bones.

03:27.750 --> 03:28.310
Your Highness,

03:28.704 --> 03:30.320
perhaps you should reconsider.

03:33.590 --> 03:34.430
Begin.

04:06.260 --> 04:11.970
♪Let it all go,
give my tears to the flowers♪

04:13.410 --> 04:17.920
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom
is more than wind and sand♪

04:17.950 --> 04:18.560
Your Highness,

04:18.630 --> 04:19.680
I beg you.

04:20.190 --> 04:21.360
Please stop.

04:23.720 --> 04:25.980
♪Hides in the clamor♪

04:27.950 --> 04:28.560
Your Highness,

04:29.360 --> 04:30.430
if it's too much to bear,

04:30.800 --> 04:32.784
we can stop for now
and proceed gradually.

04:34.310 --> 04:39.840
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

04:40.240 --> 04:42.320
♪As night stains my eyes♪

04:43.070 --> 04:44.190
Continue.

04:48.240 --> 04:51.620
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

04:51.820 --> 04:55.180
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

04:55.380 --> 04:58.950
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

04:58.950 --> 05:02.240
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

05:06.100 --> 05:08.340
(Clarity and Serenity)

05:36.000 --> 05:41.380
♪Time rushes by as spring brings life,
autumn brings death♪

05:43.080 --> 05:48.870
♪A heart weathered
by frost will melt in love♪

05:51.380 --> 05:55.740
(I personally made this soup.
Please let me know how it tastes.)

05:57.000 --> 06:02.790
♪With this broken body,
I'll become your armor♪

06:03.850 --> 06:09.460
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

06:09.620 --> 06:17.210
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

06:17.880 --> 06:21.420
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

06:21.420 --> 06:24.730
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

06:24.980 --> 06:28.420
♪In this eternity,
you are a part of it♪

06:28.420 --> 06:31.940
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

06:31.940 --> 06:35.440
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

06:35.440 --> 06:38.870
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

06:38.870 --> 06:42.370
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

06:42.370 --> 06:45.650
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

06:54.040 --> 06:54.830
Your Highness.

06:57.870 --> 06:58.870
I didn't mean to.

07:10.560 --> 07:11.870
Just pretend I did.

07:12.190 --> 07:13.120
Your Highness.

07:13.870 --> 07:14.800
Your Highness.

08:39.390 --> 08:41.120
Youyou.

08:41.440 --> 08:43.270
Luming.

08:45.120 --> 08:46.000
Your Highness.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.910
This parrot
hasn't been given a name yet.

08:48.080 --> 08:49.720
What do you think we should call it?

08:51.744 --> 08:53.056
Baisui.
[* Longevity.]

08:55.150 --> 08:56.080
Let's call it Baisui.

08:58.840 --> 08:59.790
Baisui.

09:05.000 --> 09:05.870
Baisui.

09:07.030 --> 09:08.790
Baisui.

09:12.510 --> 09:13.510
Your Majesty.

09:13.750 --> 09:15.360
Under Your Majesty's benevolent rule,

09:15.440 --> 09:17.200
the realm has enjoyed peace
for many years.

09:17.240 --> 09:19.720
Our king is deeply grateful
for Your Majesty's grace.

09:20.120 --> 09:22.960
Thus, he has sent me
to accompany Princess Yaoxi

09:22.960 --> 09:24.600
to pay tribute at court.

09:32.180 --> 09:34.980
(Princess Yaoxi, Princess of Lanhai)

09:38.600 --> 09:40.510
This Princess Yaoxi

09:41.080 --> 09:44.630
bears a striking resemblance
to Princess Yun'an,

09:45.000 --> 09:48.030
who married into the Le Tribe years ago.

10:02.000 --> 10:02.720
Your Majesty.

10:02.960 --> 10:05.030
This time, our king

10:05.030 --> 10:07.630
has entrusted me to escort
the princess to the capital

10:07.630 --> 10:09.000
for another purpose as well.

10:09.600 --> 10:10.600
Our king hopes

10:10.600 --> 10:14.150
Your Majesty will find
the princess a worthy husband.

10:16.720 --> 10:17.790
Then, Princess,

10:17.910 --> 10:20.000
have you taken a liking
to any young gentleman?

10:22.480 --> 10:23.150
Your Majesty.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.910
If my heart belongs to someone,

10:24.910 --> 10:26.688
would Your Majesty
grant us your blessing?

10:26.752 --> 10:28.480
If your feelings are mutual,

10:29.600 --> 10:30.200
I

10:31.390 --> 10:32.550
will gladly grant your wish.

10:40.080 --> 10:40.750
Your Majesty.

10:41.240 --> 10:43.120
When I was young, I met someone.

10:43.320 --> 10:44.440
I was utterly captivated.

10:45.390 --> 10:48.120
Seeing him again today,
I fell for him at first sight once more.

10:48.270 --> 10:49.480
I simply cannot forget him.

10:51.960 --> 10:53.200
Princess Yaoxi,

10:54.120 --> 10:55.390
you're frank and forthright.

10:55.390 --> 10:56.320
Go ahead and say it.

10:57.030 --> 10:57.480
I...

10:58.600 --> 10:59.790
shall speak on your behalf.

11:04.600 --> 11:07.840
I admire the Crown Prince's
majestic bearing,

11:08.240 --> 11:10.150
and I am willing to marry
into the East Palace

11:10.630 --> 11:11.790
as a secondary consort.

11:32.960 --> 11:33.790
Xihe.

11:34.150 --> 11:34.550
I...

11:35.792 --> 11:37.392
I swear I have no other intentions.

11:40.000 --> 11:41.120
Here you go again.

11:46.390 --> 11:47.270
I believe you.

11:51.790 --> 11:54.080
Huayong isn't feeling very well.

11:54.720 --> 11:56.200
You should go and get some rest.

12:14.736 --> 12:16.320
Why are you looking at me like that?

12:17.480 --> 12:19.240
Your Highness is peerless

12:19.440 --> 12:20.670
in all the world.

12:20.784 --> 12:22.510
She only met you once
when she was little,

12:23.270 --> 12:24.790
yet you stole her heart.

12:25.030 --> 12:26.870
She hasn't stopped
thinking about you since.

12:29.150 --> 12:30.120
My lady.

12:30.840 --> 12:31.510
Are you jealous?

12:31.720 --> 12:32.200
No.

12:49.720 --> 12:50.910
We're husband and wife.

12:51.024 --> 12:52.150
There's no need to be shy.

12:52.880 --> 12:54.120
So, are you jealous or not?

12:54.270 --> 12:55.200
No.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.200
Not even a little?

13:00.510 --> 13:01.240
No.

13:02.030 --> 13:02.750
Not at all?

13:03.240 --> 13:03.790
No.

13:22.592 --> 13:25.320
Has Crown Princess not
asked even once about Princess Yaoxi?

13:25.320 --> 13:26.064
No, she hasn't.

13:26.270 --> 13:27.080
Not even once?

13:28.360 --> 13:31.000
The Crown Princess sleeps well,
has a healthy appetite,

13:31.270 --> 13:32.960
and is no different from her usual self.

13:37.200 --> 13:37.870
Your Highness.

13:37.920 --> 13:39.408
Princess Yaoxi requests an audience.

13:40.864 --> 13:42.000
I will not see her.

13:42.096 --> 13:43.216
Yes, Your Highness.

13:45.200 --> 13:45.630
Wait.

13:50.120 --> 13:52.720
Escort Princess Yaoxi
to the front courtyard.

13:53.200 --> 13:54.304
Yes, Your Highness.

14:04.870 --> 14:06.630
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:08.896 --> 14:10.416
Please, have a seat, Princess.

14:16.630 --> 14:17.670
What brings

14:17.670 --> 14:18.550
you here today?

14:18.790 --> 14:21.720
I have come to ask for your forgiveness.

14:22.360 --> 14:23.150
Forgiveness?

14:23.440 --> 14:25.320
I have feelings for you, Your Highness.

14:25.630 --> 14:27.720
I spoke out impulsively at the banquet.

14:28.150 --> 14:29.440
I hope you won't take offense.

14:32.112 --> 14:34.176
What are you laughing at, Your Highness?

14:37.320 --> 14:39.030
Your father is gravely ill.

14:40.080 --> 14:42.000
His condition has worsened
in recent months.

14:42.480 --> 14:44.440
But no physician could help.

14:45.350 --> 14:46.870
Your younger brother is still a child.

14:46.880 --> 14:48.390
He has yet to establish any authority.

14:48.512 --> 14:51.120
On top of that, your uncles,
who each command military forces,

14:51.120 --> 14:52.896
are all watching the throne
with eager eyes.

14:52.910 --> 14:54.910
Your royal family's rule
is hanging by a thread.

14:55.456 --> 14:58.030
So you're eager to secure
a marriage alliance with our dynasty

14:58.120 --> 14:59.120
and seek our protection.

14:59.152 --> 15:00.896
What does any of that
have to do with love?

15:00.928 --> 15:02.750
Since Your Highness
has spoken so frankly,

15:03.360 --> 15:04.840
I won't hide the truth either.

15:05.510 --> 15:06.910
This marriage

15:07.600 --> 15:09.440
would not benefit me alone.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.320
First,

15:11.630 --> 15:13.440
I dare say I'm not lacking in beauty.

15:13.840 --> 15:14.510
Second,

15:15.270 --> 15:16.320
if you marry me,

15:16.600 --> 15:18.960
you gain half of Lanhai.

15:19.104 --> 15:21.150
My younger brother and I
are devoted to each other.

15:21.184 --> 15:22.976
Once he comes of age
and ascends the throne,

15:23.080 --> 15:25.150
he will remain unwaveringly loyal
to Your Highness.

15:25.510 --> 15:27.790
Lanhai has a powerful army.

15:28.510 --> 15:31.630
If Your Highness were to bring me
into the East Palace,

15:31.790 --> 15:33.080
that would make it even better.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.080
Isn't that a good thing?

15:46.870 --> 15:47.670
Your Highness.

15:47.790 --> 15:50.320
Princess Yaoxi and the Crown Prince
had a great conversation,

15:50.320 --> 15:52.272
and sat in the front courtyard
for a long time.

15:53.840 --> 15:54.600
Did they?

15:55.232 --> 15:57.590
What if she really asks
for an imperial decree of marriage?

15:57.600 --> 15:58.690
After all, she's a princess.

15:58.700 --> 16:00.120
And she isn't asking
for the position of Crown Princess.

16:00.200 --> 16:02.940
His Majesty and the Grand Empress
Dowager may not refuse her request.

16:08.272 --> 16:09.472
You are the Crown Prince.

16:09.480 --> 16:11.590
It's only a matter of time
before you take consorts.

16:11.600 --> 16:13.150
If I were to enter the East Palace,

16:13.150 --> 16:15.120
I would always honor
the Crown Princess above all.

16:15.152 --> 16:16.600
I would never compete for your favor.

16:16.688 --> 16:18.360
Even if I were to bear a royal grandson,

16:18.576 --> 16:20.480
he would have no claim
to the imperial throne.

16:20.550 --> 16:21.840
I have vowed

16:23.510 --> 16:24.910
to marry only the Crown Princess.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.870
Even taking a consort
in name only and not in fact

16:28.768 --> 16:30.240
would still be breaking my promise.

16:32.480 --> 16:33.720
Princess, have you heard

16:33.790 --> 16:35.030
that I am gravely ill?

16:35.120 --> 16:36.200
I do not have long to live.

16:36.624 --> 16:38.240
The physicians have declared that I have

16:39.072 --> 16:40.080
less than a year left.

16:42.360 --> 16:43.960
If I truly pass away,

16:44.270 --> 16:46.030
all the support you hope to gain

16:46.360 --> 16:47.630
will vanish with me.

16:47.630 --> 16:48.240
Even so,

16:48.464 --> 16:50.120
would you still be willing to marry me?

16:53.232 --> 16:54.390
You're quite straightforward.

16:56.200 --> 16:58.440
So, to protect your younger brother,

16:58.450 --> 17:00.784
you must help him secure
the throne before he comes of age.

17:00.910 --> 17:02.030
I'm not the right choice.

17:04.640 --> 17:05.880
Then who should I marry?

17:06.480 --> 17:07.720
Bear the consequences

17:07.920 --> 17:08.790
without regret.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.240
That choice

17:10.920 --> 17:12.310
can only be made by you.

17:21.590 --> 17:22.750
My lady.

17:23.160 --> 17:24.510
Don't prepare my dinner tonight.

17:24.896 --> 17:26.640
I have an appointment
with Princess Yaoxi.

17:29.350 --> 17:30.160
Understood.

17:42.820 --> 17:46.060
(East Palace)

17:58.160 --> 17:59.070
Your Highness.

17:59.104 --> 18:01.430
It's getting late, and Crown Prince
still hasn't returned.

18:01.440 --> 18:03.040
What kind of meal takes this long?

18:03.440 --> 18:04.920
Why don't you send someone

18:04.920 --> 18:06.448
to ask the Crown Prince to come back?

18:07.200 --> 18:08.200
Zhen Zhu, Mo Yu.

18:08.560 --> 18:09.400
Yes, Your Highness.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.270
What are your orders?

18:10.790 --> 18:11.830
Pour me a cup of tea.

18:16.000 --> 18:16.790
- Yes.
- Yes.

18:43.200 --> 18:43.920
Your Highness.

18:44.080 --> 18:46.000
You wouldn't let me
inform the Crown Princess,

18:46.010 --> 18:48.200
and Crown Princess hasn't
sent anyone to invite you back.

18:48.200 --> 18:49.110
At this rate,

18:49.424 --> 18:50.590
this can't go on like this.

18:50.590 --> 18:52.880
If she doesn't come looking
for me, I won't go back.

18:58.160 --> 18:59.440
Understood, Your Highness.

18:59.488 --> 19:01.680
You just want the Crown Princess
to get a little jealous

19:01.680 --> 19:03.056
and show that she cares about you.

19:03.240 --> 19:04.720
But in my opinion,

19:05.110 --> 19:06.720
I'm afraid that day will never come.

19:25.750 --> 19:26.720
Why are the lights out?

19:27.030 --> 19:29.510
Have you seen what time it is?

19:29.960 --> 19:31.510
It's already past bedtime.

19:35.220 --> 19:37.700
(Clarity and Serenity)

19:41.310 --> 19:42.000
Your Highness.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.240
Well...

19:43.240 --> 19:43.920
Tian Yuan.

19:46.550 --> 19:47.920
Will I never live to see

19:47.920 --> 19:49.640
the day the Crown Princess gets jealous?

19:54.440 --> 19:55.110
Your Highness.

19:55.400 --> 19:57.000
If all else fails,

19:58.110 --> 20:00.000
I think we should find a way

20:00.270 --> 20:02.480
to give ourselves a way out.

20:06.110 --> 20:07.030
At first,

20:08.550 --> 20:10.350
all I wanted was for her to marry me.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.790
I asked for nothing more.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.750
But after we got married,

20:16.200 --> 20:18.000
I couldn't stop wanting more.

20:21.000 --> 20:22.000
I don't blame her.

20:24.400 --> 20:25.110
I blame myself.

20:53.310 --> 20:54.070
Your Highness.

20:55.160 --> 20:56.550
I've already decided

20:57.000 --> 20:58.350
who I'm going to marry.

21:01.110 --> 21:02.070
His Majesty.

21:04.270 --> 21:05.440
How did Your Highness know?

21:07.790 --> 21:09.400
My father rules all under Heaven.

21:09.550 --> 21:10.480
Right now, the princess

21:11.000 --> 21:12.640
needs to protect your younger brother.

21:12.920 --> 21:14.350
Who could be a more suitable choice?

21:15.240 --> 21:16.160
Besides,

21:16.180 --> 21:18.200
my father spent half
his life on the battlefield.

21:18.200 --> 21:19.590
He is an extraordinary man.

21:21.070 --> 21:23.400
But His Majesty hasn't taken
a new consort in many years.

21:25.568 --> 21:27.632
After Princess Yun'an
married into the Le tribe,

21:27.696 --> 21:29.312
my father never took another consort.

21:29.640 --> 21:30.270
Princess Yun'an

21:30.270 --> 21:32.110
was the love of his life
that he lost forever.

21:32.750 --> 21:33.920
Princess Yun'an?

21:35.880 --> 21:37.200
Princess Yun'an...

21:37.270 --> 21:38.550
We were very close.

21:39.750 --> 21:42.240
She was gentle, virtuous,
and devoted to helping others.

21:43.270 --> 21:44.960
She watched me grow up.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.560
We were as close as mother and daughter.

21:48.310 --> 21:49.240
That's all the better.

21:49.640 --> 21:51.310
Then does Your Highness mean

21:51.904 --> 21:54.864
I should follow Princess Yun'an's
example to win His Majesty's favor?

21:55.510 --> 21:56.750
An imitation

21:56.750 --> 21:59.030
might earn you
a few extra glances from His Majesty.

22:00.832 --> 22:03.510
Your advantage doesn't lie
in imitating someone else.

22:03.920 --> 22:05.550
It's the many years

22:06.200 --> 22:08.200
you spent by Princess Yun'an's side.

22:08.200 --> 22:09.200
Through constant exposure,

22:09.200 --> 22:11.152
you naturally learned
all of her finest qualities.

22:17.232 --> 22:19.712
Perhaps it's for the best
that I'm not marrying you.

22:19.776 --> 22:22.512
You're far too skilled at reading
and influencing people's hearts.

22:23.376 --> 22:24.800
You're too kind, Princess.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.240
However,

22:27.680 --> 22:30.030
there is one person
who is beyond your control.

22:32.550 --> 22:34.000
The Crown Princess.

22:39.510 --> 22:41.350
Your Highness has gone
to such great lengths

22:41.680 --> 22:43.720
to invite me out in broad daylight

22:43.984 --> 22:46.576
just to put on a show for
the Crown Princess, haven't you?

22:47.790 --> 22:50.400
Isn't that the Crown Princess's
personal maid?

22:56.350 --> 22:57.000
She is.

22:57.616 --> 22:58.848
Princess, would you mind

22:59.136 --> 23:00.510
smiling a little more brightly?

23:03.270 --> 23:04.400
You helped me,

23:05.310 --> 23:06.310
so I'll help you.

23:08.680 --> 23:09.790
I also hope

23:10.640 --> 23:12.440
that after you marry my father,

23:13.880 --> 23:14.960
you and the Crown Princess

23:15.310 --> 23:16.270
will become allies.

23:16.880 --> 23:18.830
So Your Highness
is trying to win me over

23:18.840 --> 23:20.000
for the Crown Princess's sake?

23:20.000 --> 23:21.480
If you form an alliance in the palace,

23:21.750 --> 23:23.030
you can look after one another.

23:23.136 --> 23:25.720
I also hope that once your
younger brother ascends the throne,

23:26.000 --> 23:28.440
the Lanhai Army will stand behind
the Crown Princess as well.

23:31.070 --> 23:33.790
But everyone says the Crown Princess
is cold and ruthless.

23:34.070 --> 23:35.350
She isn't cold or ruthless.

23:37.270 --> 23:38.480
She is exceptionally wise,

23:39.200 --> 23:39.880
strong,

23:40.550 --> 23:41.240
proud,

23:42.750 --> 23:43.790
honest

23:44.160 --> 23:45.000
and genuine.

23:45.360 --> 23:46.800
When it comes to the greater good,

23:46.976 --> 23:48.352
she never shirks responsibility,

23:48.640 --> 23:50.590
nor is she ever willing
to owe anyone a debt.

23:51.720 --> 23:52.830
If you're sincere with her,

23:53.510 --> 23:54.790
she'll return that sincerity.

23:54.960 --> 23:55.880
She is

23:56.880 --> 23:58.750
the kind of ally
you can trust with your back.

24:03.110 --> 24:05.000
I believe every word
Your Highness has said.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.640
Because never before in the palace

24:08.640 --> 24:10.830
have I seen a husband

24:11.960 --> 24:13.070
admire his wife so deeply

24:13.680 --> 24:15.070
or love her so wholeheartedly.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.590
Then I also wish, Princess,

24:19.070 --> 24:20.160
that your wish comes true.

24:24.640 --> 24:26.200
This afternoon weather

24:27.000 --> 24:28.680
is becoming unbearably humid.

24:29.160 --> 24:31.880
Your Majesty, why not
rest for a while in the pavilion?

24:53.310 --> 24:55.550
These past few days,
the Crown Prince and Princess Yaoxi

24:55.550 --> 24:56.720
have been together everywhere.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.816
Shooting wooden ducks,
drinking tea, and eating fruit.

24:58.816 --> 25:00.200
They've made no attempt to hide it.

25:00.208 --> 25:02.640
Tomorrow they're even planning
to have dinner together.

25:05.270 --> 25:06.550
The time has come.

25:17.088 --> 25:18.110
What are you trying to do?

25:18.310 --> 25:19.680
Princess Yaoxi,

25:19.830 --> 25:21.000
please come with me.

25:29.680 --> 25:30.960
Shen Xihe?

25:31.590 --> 25:33.000
How dare you!

25:33.160 --> 25:34.880
I am the Princess of Lanhai.

25:35.030 --> 25:36.440
I am His Majesty's honored guest.

25:36.450 --> 25:37.790
Even if you're the Crown Princess,

25:37.790 --> 25:39.030
how dare you treat me like this?

25:39.480 --> 25:40.240
Let me go!

25:41.440 --> 25:42.750
Not only do I dare to tie you up,

25:43.240 --> 25:44.070
today,

25:44.352 --> 25:45.920
but I'm going to hang you from a tree.

25:50.070 --> 25:51.480
You're utterly outrageous.

25:51.584 --> 25:53.888
Aren't you afraid
I'll report this to His Majesty?

25:55.790 --> 25:56.510
Not at all.

25:57.920 --> 25:58.720
Hang her up.

25:58.830 --> 25:59.270
Yes.

25:59.270 --> 26:00.550
This is outrageous!

26:00.550 --> 26:02.160
I won't let this go!

26:02.160 --> 26:03.520
- Gag her.
- Don't touch me!

26:03.680 --> 26:04.160
Yes.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.270
Shen Xihe,

26:05.350 --> 26:06.240
don't touch me!

26:06.350 --> 26:07.000
Don't touch...

26:07.110 --> 26:07.880
Your Highness.

26:07.890 --> 26:09.990
Princess Yaoxi is, after all,
a princess of high rank.

26:10.000 --> 26:11.510
What exactly are you trying to do?

26:15.350 --> 26:16.440
Let me down!

26:19.640 --> 26:20.790
Let me down!

26:26.830 --> 26:28.310
Greetings, Your Majesty.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.920
Princess Yaoxi came to me in tears.

26:31.160 --> 26:32.070
She said you

26:32.160 --> 26:34.480
abducted her in broad daylight,

26:34.590 --> 26:37.310
and then hung her
from a tree outside the city.

26:37.720 --> 26:38.920
What exactly happened?

26:39.270 --> 26:40.240
Your Majesty,

26:40.960 --> 26:42.790
does Princess Yaoxi have any evidence

26:43.070 --> 26:44.270
that proves I was responsible?

26:44.270 --> 26:45.480
So you're saying

26:46.240 --> 26:47.550
that without evidence,

26:47.550 --> 26:48.830
even if you did it,

26:49.070 --> 26:50.920
nothing can be done to you?

26:51.000 --> 26:53.850
Princess Yaoxi's intentions toward
East Palace are plain for all to see.

26:54.160 --> 26:56.270
She and I are naturally at odds.

26:56.750 --> 26:59.270
Why does Your Majesty
believe only her side of the story?

26:59.920 --> 27:01.200
What if Princess Yaoxi

27:01.200 --> 27:02.920
staged this to frame me?

27:03.070 --> 27:04.070
Then what?

27:08.440 --> 27:09.240
Huayong.

27:09.536 --> 27:10.510
You're actually laughing?

27:11.110 --> 27:12.400
Just look at

27:12.640 --> 27:14.400
your sharp-tongued Crown Princess.

27:19.000 --> 27:19.790
Very well.

27:21.000 --> 27:21.960
Then we'll wait

27:22.110 --> 27:24.640
until Princess Yaoxi
has fully recovered.

27:25.110 --> 27:26.070
The two of you

27:26.200 --> 27:27.648
will confront each other in person.

27:28.550 --> 27:29.030
Yes.

27:31.000 --> 27:31.640
You...

27:34.920 --> 27:35.590
Father.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.240
If Father has no further instructions,

27:38.750 --> 27:41.000
I'll take Xihe back to the East Palace.

27:56.100 --> 27:59.540
(Sea Within the Heart)

27:59.550 --> 28:02.096
Why did you make such a spectacle
with Princess Yaoxi this time?

28:02.200 --> 28:03.590
We were putting on an act.

28:07.310 --> 28:10.110
The Crown Princess went to such lengths
to invite me here.

28:10.110 --> 28:11.350
What is this all about?

28:11.350 --> 28:13.270
How about joining forces with me?

28:13.680 --> 28:14.550
Joining forces?

28:15.744 --> 28:18.200
I know you're looking
for support for your younger brother.

28:18.320 --> 28:20.720
I'm sure the Crown Prince
has already explained everything.

28:20.944 --> 28:22.736
There's no need for me to repeat it.

28:25.200 --> 28:26.640
The two of you

28:27.310 --> 28:28.400
really are alike.

28:30.400 --> 28:31.350
I came today

28:31.640 --> 28:33.160
to lend you a hand.

28:34.736 --> 28:36.200
And how do you intend to help me?

28:36.310 --> 28:38.680
Let's make it appear
that we're sworn enemies.

28:44.400 --> 28:45.110
What do you think?

28:45.550 --> 28:46.350
Don't worry.

28:46.464 --> 28:48.720
I've arranged for Mo Yuan and Mo Yu
to stay nearby.

28:48.768 --> 28:50.672
You only need
to hang there for two hours.

28:50.680 --> 28:51.400
No.

28:51.590 --> 28:53.240
I want to stay up here all night.

28:53.790 --> 28:55.030
It's only for show.

28:55.104 --> 28:56.750
Don't have to
put yourself through this.

28:56.750 --> 28:57.640
You don't understand.

28:57.920 --> 29:00.200
Only if it looks real will
His Majesty believe it.

29:00.640 --> 29:01.880
Besides,

29:01.880 --> 29:03.440
this is the perfect chance to find out

29:03.440 --> 29:05.310
how much I truly matter to His Majesty.

29:09.160 --> 29:09.720
By the way,

29:10.400 --> 29:11.680
thank you for helping me.

29:12.350 --> 29:14.680
It's just that once word gets out,

29:14.680 --> 29:16.480
your reputation in the palace
may suffer.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.720
I don't mind

29:19.270 --> 29:20.070
being the villain.

29:22.030 --> 29:23.310
I knew it.

29:23.712 --> 29:26.270
You're the one who had
Princess Yaoxi approach His Majesty.

29:26.880 --> 29:28.590
If she's bullied and falls ill,

29:28.624 --> 29:30.352
His Majesty will only dote on her more.

29:30.510 --> 29:32.160
I'm simply giving you a helping hand.

29:33.960 --> 29:35.510
My lady is truly perceptive.

29:36.680 --> 29:39.680
If Princess Yaoxi
enters the palace as a consort,

29:39.696 --> 29:41.680
she'll be able to support
her younger brother.

29:41.880 --> 29:42.920
As for me,

29:43.030 --> 29:44.480
I'll gain another ally

29:44.960 --> 29:47.110
in the inner palace.

29:47.200 --> 29:48.830
Once her younger brother comes to power,

29:48.880 --> 29:51.200
he'll command the hundreds
of thousands of Lanhai troops.

29:51.590 --> 29:52.550
What you've done today

29:52.592 --> 29:54.176
will not only stabilize
the inner palace,

29:54.200 --> 29:55.376
but also secure the border.

29:55.720 --> 29:56.790
That's one reason.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.350
The second

29:58.752 --> 30:00.688
is that I want
to make an example of her.

30:01.160 --> 30:02.400
So everyone will know

30:03.000 --> 30:05.440
that any lady who sets
her sights on the Crown Prince

30:05.550 --> 30:07.000
will end up just like Princess Yaoxi.

30:10.550 --> 30:11.510
Do you really mean that?

30:12.160 --> 30:14.480
You've been spending
so much time with Princess Yaoxi.

30:14.576 --> 30:16.416
Weren't you doing it just for me to see?

30:16.464 --> 30:18.310
You always think
I don't care enough about you

30:18.310 --> 30:19.240
or get jealous.

30:22.592 --> 30:24.288
What did you mean by what you just said?

30:24.830 --> 30:25.830
You have feelings for me?

30:25.830 --> 30:26.550
You're jealous?

30:26.550 --> 30:27.880
You're always thinking of me.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.200
So, of course,

30:29.200 --> 30:30.880
I should make you happy once in a while.

30:39.790 --> 30:40.440
Tian Yuan.

31:24.830 --> 31:26.960
His Majesty's decree.

31:28.270 --> 31:31.920
Princess Yaoxi is hereby bestowed
the title of Consort Shu,

31:32.240 --> 31:34.830
ranking among the Four Senior Consorts.

31:35.000 --> 31:37.030
By imperial decree.

31:39.200 --> 31:40.550
Thank you, Your Majesty.

32:06.512 --> 32:08.880
- Greetings, Consort Shu.
- Greetings, Consort Shu.

32:13.960 --> 32:14.720
Young Master Bu.

32:14.720 --> 32:16.208
- Young Master Bu.
- Young Master Bu.

32:18.144 --> 32:19.030
This one's good.

32:21.720 --> 32:23.350
Look at this. This one.

32:23.960 --> 32:24.830
Now that's impressive.

32:25.880 --> 32:26.440
Look.

32:29.920 --> 32:31.070
Hey, what are you doing?

32:31.080 --> 32:32.920
When the young masters
of noble families gather,

32:32.920 --> 32:33.960
they compose poetry.

32:33.960 --> 32:36.450
How is it that you always
end up looking at this sort of thing?

32:36.550 --> 32:38.272
I'm taking these. No more reading them.

32:40.350 --> 32:42.000
Lin, what's gotten into you?

32:42.590 --> 32:45.350
Weren't these books
the ones you gave us?

32:49.240 --> 32:50.070
What are you doing?

32:50.350 --> 32:51.200
What am I doing?

32:51.400 --> 32:52.590
I'm burning them.

32:53.030 --> 32:54.000
- No!
- No!

32:54.830 --> 32:55.680
Why burn them?

32:55.880 --> 32:56.960
I have to.

32:57.200 --> 32:57.680
Don't.

32:58.680 --> 32:59.790
No... Don't!

33:05.720 --> 33:07.160
You two, take a break.

33:13.270 --> 33:14.310
What brings you here?

33:15.872 --> 33:18.960
It's one thing for you young masters
to spend your days chasing after women

33:19.040 --> 33:20.912
instead of doing something worthwhile.

33:21.310 --> 33:22.160
But now,

33:22.440 --> 33:24.030
you've become this brazen.

33:24.400 --> 33:26.110
Don't any of you think
this is disgraceful

33:26.110 --> 33:27.280
and dishonors your family?

33:33.750 --> 33:35.640
We're only reading these in private.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.770
It's not against the rules.

33:36.790 --> 33:37.480
What about you?

33:37.808 --> 33:39.824
Did you get our permission
to come in here?

33:40.000 --> 33:41.960
And now you're
standing there judging us.

33:41.960 --> 33:42.680
Exactly.

33:43.510 --> 33:46.400
Isn't Vice Minister Cui
here among the flowers, too?

33:46.590 --> 33:48.160
Don't be a hypocrite.

33:58.336 --> 33:59.344
Tonight's on me.

33:59.392 --> 34:00.780
We're not leaving until we're drunk.

34:00.790 --> 34:01.400
Good!

34:01.400 --> 34:02.590
- Good!
- Good!

34:02.590 --> 34:03.510
Come on.

34:03.830 --> 34:04.350
Come on!

34:04.350 --> 34:06.400
Here, pour the liquor. Let's keep going.

34:35.360 --> 34:37.184
- Young Master Bu.
- Young Master Bu.

35:09.880 --> 35:11.800
Vice Minister Cui,
you're in quite the mood.

35:11.840 --> 35:12.800
Why are you still here?

35:12.912 --> 35:15.120
You ordered liquor,
yet you haven't had a single drink.

35:16.512 --> 35:17.610
Were you worried about me?

35:17.984 --> 35:20.000
Shouldn't you be back
in your gentle paradise?

35:20.592 --> 35:22.320
What brings you
to my quiet little corner?

35:24.440 --> 35:26.190
That bunch can't hold their liquor.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.800
They're already completely wasted.

35:33.840 --> 35:35.150
Actually,

35:35.150 --> 35:37.630
I was trying to snatch those
books away and burn them.

36:13.510 --> 36:14.920
What exactly are you trying to do?

36:14.920 --> 36:15.920
I'm here to apologize.

36:16.440 --> 36:17.550
I made you angry earlier.

36:17.550 --> 36:19.472
I'll punish myself
with three cups of liquor.

36:32.150 --> 36:33.150
You want to drink?

36:34.230 --> 36:34.670
Fine.

36:35.488 --> 36:37.584
I'll drink with you
for as long as you want.

37:21.190 --> 37:21.960
That's it.

37:22.510 --> 37:23.320
It's all gone.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.150
Still want to drink?

37:26.320 --> 37:26.920
Yes.

37:27.320 --> 37:27.880
All right.

37:28.670 --> 37:29.440
I'll get more.

38:36.380 --> 38:38.736
Changmin already suspects
that Bu Shulin is a lady.

38:38.740 --> 38:40.750
He plans to expose it
through an arranged marriage.

38:40.760 --> 38:41.880
Someone, help!

38:42.000 --> 38:43.070
- The Fourteenth Prince has fallen into the water!
- Help me!

38:43.070 --> 38:43.670
Someone!

38:44.150 --> 38:44.960
Young Master Bu.

38:45.280 --> 38:46.150
Are you all right?

38:48.360 --> 38:50.070
Has your poison flared up again?

38:50.630 --> 38:51.440
It's nothing.

38:52.140 --> 38:57.250
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

38:59.271 --> 39:02.211
♪I've hidden so many words♪

39:02.831 --> 39:05.631
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

39:06.501 --> 39:13.471
♪So never uncover♪

39:13.661 --> 39:16.021
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

39:17.151 --> 39:19.881
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

39:20.841 --> 39:26.181
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

39:27.941 --> 39:30.761
♪Every answer I gave♪

39:31.561 --> 39:34.411
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

39:35.201 --> 39:38.571
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

39:38.831 --> 39:42.141
♪How hard it truly was?♪

39:45.111 --> 39:48.551
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

39:49.541 --> 39:51.871
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

39:53.141 --> 39:58.901
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

40:00.311 --> 40:03.441
♪It's a shame I never could♪

40:03.891 --> 40:06.901
♪Give you a moon in return♪

40:07.011 --> 40:13.651
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

40:13.651 --> 40:17.321
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

40:18.191 --> 40:20.951
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

40:21.391 --> 40:24.521
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

40:24.961 --> 40:30.911
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

40:32.311 --> 40:35.861
♪You'll never♪

40:36.141 --> 40:45.611
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

41:11.781 --> 41:15.261
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
